### 1. CRJudgeBench (most important)
HF dataset `dcloud347/CRJudgeBenchmark` (files test.jsonl, train.jsonl, validation.jsonl; download via https://huggingface.co/datasets/dcloud347/CRJudgeBenchmark/resolve/main/test.jsonl). 1,199 real PR review comments labelled trustworthy vs untrustworthy (plausible but wrong). Published test-set (359 rows) accuracy: Sentinel 76.60%, GLM-5.3 70.47%. Inspect the schema first. For each test row, build state = patch + whatever code/context fields exist (truncate to ~1M chars), ask SubQ whether the comment is technically correct/trustworthy. Pick the probability threshold on the validation split, report test accuracy, plus AUROC and accuracy at 0.5. Compare to the published numbers in a table.

